{"step_index":1651,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-29T02:23:58Z","content":"Agora os pro-tips e command categories (linhas 257-320):","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Clean all pro-tip cards and command category headers: remove emojis","EndLine":319,"Instruction":"Remove all emojis from pro-tips and command categories","ReplacementContent":"                        <div class=\"pro-tips-section\">\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card\">\n                                <h4>Stealth Tip</h4>\n                                <p>Always interact with the app using <strong>Global Hotkeys</strong>. Clicking on the\n                                    window during a proctored exam may trigger focus-detection alerts from monitoring\n                                    software.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card vision\">\n                                <h4>Multi-Screenshot Analysis</h4>\n                                <p>You can capture multiple screenshots with <kbd>Alt+S</kbd> to build a queue, then\n                                    process them all at once with <kbd>Alt+P</kbd>. This is highly recommended for\n                                    complex multi-part coding questions.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card performance\">\n                                <h4>Speed Strategy</h4>\n                                <p>If your primary AI model is lagging, use <kbd>Alt+E</kbd> to immediately trigger\n                                    Auto-Select. Spectra will switch you to the fastest healthy provider available.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"commands-grid\">\n                            <div class=\"command-category\">\n                                <h5>Stealth</h5>\n                                <ul class=\"command-list\">\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+X</kbd> <span>Toggle Ghost Mode (Click-through)</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+Z</kbd> <span>Toggle Visibility (Show/Hide)</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+1</kbd> <span>Set Transparent (40% Opacity)</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+2</kbd> <span>Set Semi-Opaque (70% Opacity)</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+3</kbd> <span>Set Fully Opaque (100% Opacity)</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"command-category\">\n                                <h5>AI Models</h5>\n                                <ul class=\"command-list\">\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+Q</kbd> <span>Switch to Primary Preset</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+W</kbd> <span>Switch to Secondary Preset</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+E</kbd> <span>Auto-Select Best Available</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+T</kbd> <span>Switch Vision AI Model</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"command-category\">\n                                <h5>Vision</h5>\n                                <ul class=\"command-list\">\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+V</kbd> <span>Toggle Vision Mode Overlay</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+S</kbd> <span>Capture/Queue Screenshot</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+P</kbd> <span>Process Screenshot Queue</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+R</kbd> <span>Clear Screenshot Queue</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"command-category\">\n                                <h5>Controls</h5>\n                                <ul class=\"command-list\">\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+M</kbd> <span>Toggle Mic Mute</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+U</kbd> <span>Universal Pause/Mute</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+O</kbd> <span>Reset Interview Session</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+↑/↓</kbd> <span>Continuous Scrolling</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+Arrows</kbd> <span>Move Window Precision</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>","StartLine":256,"TargetContent":"                        <div class=\"pro-tips-section\">\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card\">\n                                <h4>🥷 Stealth Professional Tip</h4>\n                                <p>Always interact with the app using <strong>Global Hotkeys</strong>. Clicking on the\n                                    window during a proctored exam may trigger focus-detection alerts from monitoring\n                                    software.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card vision\">\n                                <h4>📸 Multi-Screenshot Analysis</h4>\n                                <p>You can capture multiple screenshots with <kbd>Alt+S</kbd> to build a queue, then\n                                    process them all at once with <kbd>Alt+P</kbd>. This is highly recommended for\n                                    complex multi-part coding questions.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"pro-tip-card performance\">\n                                <h4>⚡ Speed Strategy</h4>\n                                <p>If your primary AI model