bd>Alt+V</kbd> <span>Toggle Vision Mode Overlay</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+S</kbd> <span>Capture/Queue Screenshot</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+P</kbd> <span>Process Screenshot Queue</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+R</kbd> <span>Clear Screenshot Queue</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"command-category\">\n                                <h5>🕹️ Interaction & Utils</h5>\n                                <ul class=\"command-list\">\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+M</kbd> <span>Toggle Mic Mute</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+U</kbd> <span>Universal Pause/Mute</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+O</kbd> <span>Reset Interview Session</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+↑/↓</kbd> <span>Continuous Scrolling</span></li>\n                                    <li><kbd>Alt+Arrows</kbd> <span>Move Window Precision</span></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>","TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web\\index.html","toolAction":"Cleaning pro-tips and commands","toolSummary":"Clean pro-tips and commands"}}]}
